# Click To Call SDK Conventions

## Formatting

- Use **Biome** (not Prettier/ESLint) — configured in `biome.json`
- Indent with tabs, double quotes for strings
- Run `npx @biomejs/biome lint .` to check, `npm run lint` to auto-fix

## Type Organization

- Public types: `src/types/index.ts` — re-exported via `src/index.ts`
- Internal types: `src/types/internal.ts` — never exported publicly
- Prefix interfaces with descriptive names, not `I` prefix

## Event System

- All event names live in `COGNIGY_WEBRTC_EVENTS` in `src/utils/events.ts`
- New events must be added there AND have a callback type in `src/types/index.ts`
- Managers extend `SDKEventEmitter` from `src/utils/events.ts`

## Module Pattern

- Each manager is a single class in its own file under `src/`
- `WebRTCClient` is the orchestrator — it wires managers together
- New public methods go on `WebRTCClient`, not on individual managers

## Commits

- Use conventional commits: `feat(scope):`, `fix(scope):`, `chore:`, etc.
- Commitlint enforces this via husky `commit-msg` hook

## Build Outputs

- UMD: `dist/webRTCSDK.js`, CJS: `dist/webRTCSDK.cjs.js`, ES: `dist/webRTCSDK.es.js`
- Types: `dist/index.d.ts` via `vite-plugin-dts`
- All public exports go through `src/index.ts`
